  <x:String x:Key="String.CurrentMode">Current mode</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.HelpHint">Usage, shortcuts, and data handling for your current configuration.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.HelpTitle">Help &amp; About</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.LanguageApplied">Interface language saved and applied. Other inputs are unchanged.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.LocalLlmData">The current endpoint is local; text is sent to the loopback service.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.LocalVisionData">The current endpoint is local; images and text go to the loopback service.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.baidu.Method">Baidu OCR → Baidu Translation</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.baidu.Name">Baidu Cloud</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.baidu.Needs">Requires internet access and both OCR and translation credentials. Baidu receives the selected image and recognized text; service charges may apply.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.baidu.Use">For users with configured Baidu services. Both OCR and translation run in the cloud.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.custom.Method">Choose OCR, translation, and target language independently</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.custom.Name">Custom combination</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.custom.Needs">Opens Recognition &amp; translation settings. Keeps your endpoint, model, and credentials.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.custom.Use">For Google Cloud, direct multimodal OCR, or other local/cloud combinations.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.llm.Method">PaddleOCR OCR → Configured compatible LLM</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.llm.Name">LLM translation</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.llm.Needs">Configure a text model and compatible endpoint first.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.llm.Use">For model-assisted wording and broader language needs. Speed, language coverage, and quality depend on the selected model.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.offline.Method">PaddleOCR OCR → Argos translation</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.offline.Name">Offline essentials</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.offline.Needs">Fully local. Requires the offline baseline models; no cloud keys are needed.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.offline.Use">For everyday Chinese/English text extraction and basic translation, without an LLM.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.vision.Method">PaddleOCR draft + Multimodal correction → LLM translation</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.vision.Name">Visual correction</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.vision.Needs">Requires a vision model and an endpoint supporting image_url.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Mode.vision.Use">A second pass for small text or unusual fonts. Requires extra inference time; table or formula accuracy is not guaranteed.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.OcrBaiduData">OCR: the selected image is sent to Baidu OCR.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.OcrGoogleData">OCR: the selected image is sent to Google Cloud Vision.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.OcrLocalData">OCR: PaddleOCR processes the image on this device.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.OcrLoopbackData">OCR: the image is sent to the configured local multimodal endpoint.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.OcrRemoteData">OCR: the selected image is sent to the configured remote multimodal endpoint.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.OnDemand">On demand · Checked and started when capturing</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.OpenSettings">Open settings</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.OtherShortcuts">Esc: cancel region selection.&#10;Ctrl+,: open Settings from the main window.&#10;F5: refresh status in the main window.&#10;Ctrl+S: save configuration in Settings.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.PickerHint">Compare use cases, processing methods, and requirements. Selecting a card does not apply it.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.PickerTitle">Choose a processing mode</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.PrivacyBody">PingYi does not keep a history of screenshots, recognized text, or translations, and does not put this content or credentials in logs. Displayed results are held in memory.&#10;&#10;Cloud OCR sends the selected image to its provider. Multimodal endpoints also receive images. Cloud translation sends recognized text. Whether a compatible endpoint runs locally depends on its actual address; the endpoint itself controls its own data processing.&#10;&#10;Model downloads, credential validation, and manual update checks use the network. Automatic update checks run only after you enable them. Keys use system secure storage; if the Linux key service is unavailable they remain in the current session only.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.PrivacyTitle">Privacy &amp; data</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.QuickHelp">Quick start</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.QuickHelpBody">Select Start capture or use the global shortcut, then drag to select an area. Release to recognize and translate. In the result card, select text, copy the source or translation, process again, or pin the card. Change engines and target languages in Settings → Recognition &amp; translation.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.RemoteLlmData">The current endpoint is remote; it requires a connection and receives recognized text.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.RemoteVisionData">The current endpoint is remote; it requires a connection and receives the selected image and text.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Repository">Project &amp; documentation</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.ResultTitle">Recognition results</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Retry">Process again</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.SettingsReady">Settings are ready. Language selection applies immediately; save other changes below.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.StartCapture">Start capture</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.TranslationBaiduData">Translation: recognized text is sent to Baidu Translation.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.TranslationGoogleData">Translation: recognized text is sent to Google Cloud Translation.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.TranslationLocalData">Translation: Argos processes the text on this device.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.TranslationLoopbackData">Translation: recognized text is sent to the configured local compatible endpoint.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.TranslationRemoteData">Translation: recognized text is sent to the configured remote compatible endpoint.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.UnknownDataRoute">Check the service configuration for this provider’s data handling.</x:String>
